  description: "Vorrath was never meant to exist. It is the result of multiple failed
    experiments merging around the E-Core\u2019s central chamber. Unlike other mutations,
    Vorrath demonstrates strategic thinking and territorial dominance. Many researchers
    believe the disaster did not create Vorrath\u2014it awakened it."
  vnDescription: "Vorrath v\u1ED1n kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o ra \u0111\u1EC3
    t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i. N\xF3 l\xE0 k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 c\u1EE7a nhi\u1EC1u th\xED nghi\u1EC7m
    th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i h\u1EE3p nh\u1EA5t xung quanh bu\u1ED3ng trung t\xE2m c\u1EE7a
    E-Core. Kh\xF4ng gi\u1ED1ng nh\u01B0 c\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9t bi\u1EBFn kh\xE1c,
    Vorrath th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n t\u01B0 duy chi\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3c v\xE0 kh\u1EA3
    n\u0103ng th\u1ED1ng tr\u1ECB l\xE3nh th\u1ED5. Nhi\u1EC1u nh\xE0 nghi\xEAn c\u1EE9u
    tin r\u1EB1ng th\u1EA3m h\u1ECDa kh\xF4ng t\u1EA1o ra Vorrath m\xE0 ch\u1EC9
    \u0111\xE1nh th\u1EE9c n\xF3."
